V14.4
- Fixed four-room target-margin long-press at the source badge node.
- Binding now happens whenever v51EnsureProtectionMarginBadge() returns the live badge.
- Removed dependency on editor delegation / editable CSS class for activation.
- Desktop uses direct mouse long-press; mobile uses direct touch long-press; context-menu remains a fallback.
- Existing per-product/per-room override data logic, confirmation, protection-floor recalculation, and global Settings isolation are unchanged.
- Version/build updated to V14.4 / 14400.

V14.3
- Fix Random current-room badge at the legacy source: v77CurrentRoom/v77RoomLabel now recognize Random.
- Restore Random video URL input in the media section.
- Global room status colors: published blue, saved green.
- Remove repeated room product ID from room labels and remove duplicate Random quantity chip.
- Replace fragile per-badge profit-margin long-press binding with one delegated window-capture controller that survives re-render.

V14.1
- Fix Premium/Starter Variations toggle disappearing: legacy V7.0/V7.1 no longer hides the whole Individual Trees section when Variations is OFF.
- Stop cloning the live Variations checkbox so its state/events survive editor renders.
- Fix four-room target-margin long-press using a direct live-badge controller with contextmenu fallback.
- Preserve V14.0 navigation fix and Random quantity rules.

V14.0 CLEAN

- Fixed top room navigation from Bonsai Content Templates: VIP / Premium / Starter / Random now leave the template panel and open the selected room directly.
- Restored Premium / Starter Variations in the Individual Trees header; new products default OFF, while VIP / Random remain non-Child rooms.
- Restored per-product, per-room target-net-margin long-press editing for VIP / Premium / Starter / Random. Overrides support positive, zero and negative values, require confirmation, never write back to Settings, and clear when the product is removed from that room.
- Fixed Random listing quantity: Random no longer inherits the fixed Qty 1 card. Quantity starts blank until explicitly entered, supports 1-20, and remains capped by effective available stock.
- VIP / Premium / Starter mother-product direct listing remains fixed Qty 1.
- Updated all visible/runtime version markers, manifest, version.json and service-worker cache to V14.0 / build 14000.

V14.3
- Rebuilt four-room target-margin editing interaction.
- Long-press now uses one stable editor-level controller instead of window-level delegation.
- Replaced delayed browser prompt with an in-app margin editor dialog.
- Per-room/per-product margin overrides continue to support positive, zero, and negative values without changing the global Settings rate.
